1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:03,612
Meet Terrasight: the AI assistant for farmers.

2
00:00:03,992 --> 00:00:07,827
Draw a field, and forty-five years of NASA data go to work.

3
00:00:08,207 --> 00:00:14,223
Eighteen seasons of history, and a shifting climate: first frost, nine days later.

4
00:00:14,603 --> 00:00:17,810
It plans five seasons: thirty-two dollars more per acre.

5
00:00:18,190 --> 00:00:21,824
Ask it anything. Every number is checked, never invented.

6
00:00:22,204 --> 00:00:25,204
And it shows where it was wrong: four years of ten.

7
00:00:25,584 --> 00:00:29,257
Terrasight: NASA data, for your next decision.
